{"ID":"20240513083320-lakglgl","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083320-lakglgl","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083320-lakglgl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513113440-37no2j2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513113552-k87fbwh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1899,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513113552-k87fbwh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:495,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:495\u0026#125;","title":"090","type":"doc","updated":"20240515123559"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513113440-37no2j2","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 886px;","id":"20240513113440-37no2j2","updated":"20240515123559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪醫師病案紀錄   初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"073-1 L, L"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"17歲，瘦小"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20080312"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. Angelman syndrome"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. Seizure(Angelman syndrome中有大於80%的小朋友會在3歲之前發作)，二、三年前開始服用西藥後，病人變得更昏睡、流口水，且仍有大發作。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 胃口不好，挑食"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 大便正常一日一二次"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 睡約4小時即醒(服用褪黑激素助眠)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 不渴，須強迫喝水"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→裡寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 走路有如舞蹈症"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 有聲音，但無法說話"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 時全身緊繃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"細小無力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙眼無神，腎陽反應差"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、身體："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肢體緊繃、不自主抖動(趺厥)、無法挺直、流口水"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. HT-42控涎丹  早餐前15顆"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→清胸中積痰，由大便出"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 藜蘆五分  甘草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→藜蘆甘草湯，清血脈神經中積痰，取吐法  "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"半夏二錢  南星一錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→清肺中痰水  "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三碗煮一碗  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各一碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"處方1與2隔日交替服"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 小建中湯"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→健胃口，增加自體的抗病能力，排出痰水 200粉  早晚飯前二匙加一匙麥芽糖"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 小麥一兩  甘草五錢  大棗十枚"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→甘麥大棗湯，如見神靈狀用之，甘味亦可緩筋急"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"14付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"六碗煮兩碗  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"加蔗糖二匙  當飯吃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n1."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 服中藥同時，令其將西藥減量。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 此症來源: 寶寶出生時沒有頭下腳上、拍屁股令寶寶大聲哭出，同時排淨肺中羊水導致。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"Angelman syndrome之特徵: 小朋友約6-12個月大開始出現發育遲緩，尤其是功能方面；語言障礙；活動不平衡；行為上可能合併有經常笑、表面上快樂、易被刺激的性格、手拍打的動作、過動行為、短暫的注意力集中。超過80%的小朋友顱骨不成比例的發育，形成小頭畸形；3歲之前即有痙攣(seizure)發作。其他可能有，斜視、吞嚥問題、睡眠問題、流口水、吐舌頭、特別易受“水”的吸引."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240513113551-fgifsbn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240513113551-fgifsbn"}},{"ID":"20240513113552-k87fbwh","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 880px;","id":"20240513113552-k87fbwh","updated":"20240515123544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪醫師病案紀錄   初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"L, L"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"17歲，瘦小"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20080418"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. Angelman syndrome"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.  Seizure(Angelman syndrome中有大於80%的小朋友會在3歲之前發作)，二、三年前開始服用西藥後，病人變得更昏睡、流口水，且仍有大發作。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 服藜蘆甘草湯後，無明顯變化，仍有痙攣發作"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 手冰"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 無口渴，須強迫她喝水"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 仍有舞蹈狀"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 睡尚好，因服褪黑激素"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 胃口好，但挑食"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 大便有些軟，無明顯的痰排出"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. 睡時喉中無痰聲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9. 四肢仍緊繃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10. 流口水"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→白津出，應用生附子、乾薑去裡寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11. 不易出汗"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→乾薑開肺，去肺中寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12. 曲身走路挺不直"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→陽虛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"微細無力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：\n2、眼診：\n3、身體："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心陽不振，痰阻血脈神經"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"藜蘆一錢(棉布另包)  甘草二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→藜蘆甘草湯去血脈神經中的積痰"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"半夏三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→去肺中痰水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"百合五錢  熟地黃二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→百合地黃湯，舞蹈症用之"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝三錢  白芍三錢大棗十枚  小麥五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→甘麥大棗湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黃二錢  細辛一錢半"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"七付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"六碗煮二碗  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各半碗  每服加蔗糖二匙"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 此人手足冰、脈微細無力為四逆證，應用四逆湯去其裡寒，但擔心其母不慎誤用，造成意外，故不用生附子。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}